# Flutter tooling state. `npm run format` (run by the pre-commit hook, which
# then does `git add -A`) would otherwise rewrite the JSON the Flutter tool
# keeps under .dart_tool on every commit made from a machine that has run
# `flutter pub get` — reformatting a build system's own cache files is at
# best noise and at worst invalidates them.
